    "source_segments": [
      "Hey man you're doing a good job. Hey, here's a dollar. A dollar? Are you serious man?",
      "Hey real quick man are you hungry? I got this plate of food and I'm not feeling it man.",
      "And I don't want to toss it out. How's the whole bunch of greens? Are you okay with that? Yeah, yeah I'm so hungry. I'll take whatever you got.",
      "Hey dude hop in real quick. I got you man. Okay?",
      "Hey there's my big man. Hey real quick dude. When was the last time you ate? You seem pretty excited over this.",
      "Oh it's probably been two days man. Two whole days?",
      "So wait, how do you mean? Oh wait here you go man. I want to give that to you.",
      "I'm also going to give this to you man. So how do you manage to get food? Before you open that, how do you manage to get food out here man?",
      "Honestly I just dig through the trash can. I don't know there.",
      "Come on. So wait you tell me that you eat other people's trash just to feed yourself?",
      "Yeah man it's... Is that normal out here?",
      "Yeah I don't got any other choice. I don't got money. Yeah.",
      "So right now you clean windows and what's the average that someone gives you for doing that type of job?",
      "Sometimes I do it for as low as like ten cents. Really? Just any guy's being...",
      "Yeah man. And look Jonathan right?",
      "Yeah. Jonathan you seem smart. You seem young. I mean I don't know what went wrong.",
      "I mean... I don't even like to talk about it because yeah I'm young. I'm only 25.",
      "Uh huh. I grew up with... they got families and everything. They got it all and I'm homeless.",
      "Yeah. I mean was it was just kind of like bad decisions in life or is it just kind of a lot of things to all on it?",
      "Honestly it's just a lot of... like I lost my mom.",
      "Oh wow. I'm sorry.",
      "I lost my job. I lost the house. I couldn't afford to pay everything. And you know what like people like me it's tough to get out of situations like this.",
      "I'm already at a disadvantage and now I'm homeless.",
      "So it builds up throughout the time you know?",
      "And I'm sorry to hear that. How long have you been out here?",
      "Maybe like a year. Shut up. You've been doing this for a whole year now?",
      "Oh well look Jonathan. I'm going to let you go here but before I do...",
      "What was the last time you slept in the bed? A year.",
      "Alright that's all I need to hear. Before you go I want to make sure...",
      "You like greens right? I'm not a big greens person.",
      "I just go ahead and give them out to whoever needs it the most. But I'll give it to you for today then.",
      "It's just $3,000. I really hope that can help you in some type of way man."
    ],
